{"id":"e34eaef3-849c-4d97-8966-74686c838440","expr":"(byte2 & 0xFF) >= 0x80 && (byte2 & 0xFF) <= 0xBF","rationale":"Trailing UTF-8 bytes are in range 0x80 to 0xBF, so this invariant checks that byte2 fits this format.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.DecodeUtil#checkUtf8(byte,byte):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/Utf8Utils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:47.326873715Z"}
