{"id":"76f5739d-4ddf-478a-a3aa-de7e7cc1aab0","expr":"!logger.isTraceEnabled() || (throwable == null || logger.isTraceEnabled())","rationale":"If tracing is not enabled, no trace call occurs; if enabled, throwable may be null or not.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.743042253Z"}
{"id":"cbaeabd7-df28-44c1-95c9-2aaea9f44b2b","expr":"logger.isTraceEnabled() || throwable == null","rationale":"If logger.isTraceEnabled() is false, then throwable can be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.743042253Z"}
{"id":"0f48afa0-2a3b-4110-863c-6ea84a62d084","expr":"logger != null || !logger.isTraceEnabled()","rationale":"This captures the early return when logger is null, so trace is not enabled in that case.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.743668156Z"}
{"id":"73346220-240d-4f35-8f9e-9ae18b78df29","expr":"(e != null) == true || e == null","rationale":"Parameter e can be null or an instance of Throwable.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.743764197Z"}
{"id":"4fa32a06-1a76-42ae-8cd4-b8d892759753","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"Early return if logger is null, so at method exit logger is not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.743764197Z"}
{"id":"7845edf7-7b0f-4f22-8aa9-d5940fd8f22f","expr":"(msg == null) || (msg != null)","rationale":"msg is a String parameter passed to trace method; no explicit null check, so may be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.743764197Z"}
{"id":"f19cc2ef-8a4b-41da-b588-c2009c316db3","expr":"!logger.isTraceEnabled() || (msg != null || e != null)","rationale":"Suggests meaningful logging requires either msg or e.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.743668156Z"}
{"id":"61dafa2d-c145-48c6-96a2-796dee27dab7","expr":"logger.isTraceEnabled() == false || (logger.isTraceEnabled() && true)","rationale":"Trivial truth about the return type of isTraceEnabled.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.743668156Z"}
{"id":"5eba06c5-5aa1-441e-9cca-d02e32d131a9","expr":"logger != null && !logger.isDebugEnabled() || logger.isDebugEnabled() && msg != null || logger.isDebugEnabled() && msg == null","rationale":"The only way for execution to reach this point is if logger is non-null. If logger is debug-enabled, it has logged the msg which may be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.744467986Z"}
{"id":"7896160a-da57-4e89-b80a-1bca7a38cddc","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"At method exit, logger must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.744467986Z"}
{"id":"7a914d31-aed0-4ee4-b97d-d4e76e877f10","expr":"!logger.isDebugEnabled() || (logger.isDebugEnabled() && true)","rationale":"logger.isDebugEnabled() determines whether logger.debug(msg) is called.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.744467986Z"}
{"id":"284c745f-a52a-49db-b2c2-70caa22ace0b","expr":"logger != null || logger == null","rationale":"logger can be either null or not null before the method executes.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.744479258Z"}
{"id":"10521d70-3aed-4927-b969-e193ec9d58d3","expr":"msg == null || msg != null","rationale":"msg can be either null or not null before the method executes.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.744479258Z"}
{"id":"a8acb7fc-321e-4f40-84d0-4ef5bbd8f19f","expr":"logger != null || !logger.isDebugEnabled()","rationale":"If logger is null, the method returns early; thus before the method proceeds, if logger is null, no debug action occurs.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.744479258Z"}
{"id":"4d0eabd5-3a9c-4caf-9cbb-e72736001e45","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"Since method returns early if logger is null, assuming precondition that logger is non-null when considering further execution.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.744479258Z"}
{"id":"a2e0e9cd-bf6e-494f-a74f-9f4aeba78e5a","expr":"logger != null || e == null","rationale":"Method returns immediately if logger is null","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.744724992Z"}
{"id":"734903bb-ba57-45d6-8536-d236b58a0c7a","expr":"!logger.isDebugEnabled() || e != null","rationale":"If logger is debug enabled then method tries to log e","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.744724992Z"}
{"id":"68e8b94d-5b30-499b-aa2c-38817f9067b1","expr":"!logger.isDebugEnabled() || msg != null || msg == null","rationale":"If debug is enabled, logger.debug(msg) will be called with msg, which can be null or non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.744479258Z"}
{"id":"9eef97b1-982d-44e1-85ce-170b1544b4c2","expr":"logger.isDebugEnabled() == (logger != null && logger.isDebugEnabled())","rationale":"logger.isDebugEnabled() implies logger is not null","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.744724992Z"}
{"id":"0bf39f33-ff0c-41b6-bc95-dfbacac90cf5","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"logger is definitely not null at method entry (within method body)","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.744724992Z"}
{"id":"684ca9f3-96b5-48ea-be15-f5f67e4721d6","expr":"logger != null && logger.isDebugEnabled() == true && e != null","rationale":"When logger is non-null and debug is enabled, e used in debug call implying e is likely non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.745673574Z"}
{"id":"9866536d-46a8-4862-89a2-5be7bacb2e0b","expr":"logger == null || logger.isDebugEnabled() == false","rationale":"If logger is null or debug disabled, method exits early.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.745673574Z"}
{"id":"7276adae-2b0b-4dd7-90ad-d959babe904e","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"Upon method exit, logger must be non-null or method would have returned earlier.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.745673574Z"}
{"id":"85f34ff8-794b-4eb9-9d04-8be9d28dffcb","expr":"! (logger != null && logger.isDebugEnabled()) || e == null","rationale":"Either debug is not enabled or e is null (complement of debug call with e non-null).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.745673574Z"}
{"id":"b696e4e4-8f9b-4570-8e32-c4a961052d83","expr":"logger != null || msg == null","rationale":"logger can be null at method entry, no precondition requires otherwise.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.746240415Z"}
{"id":"e5a39b62-32f1-48ab-aa5b-c1503caee72c","expr":"logger == null || !logger.isDebugEnabled() || msg != null","rationale":"To call logger.debug(msg, e), msg typically should not be null if debug enabled.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.746240415Z"}
{"id":"3f350bc1-ed39-485b-b3a4-92bbfadea6ca","expr":"! (logger != null && logger.isDebugEnabled()) || e != null","rationale":"If debug is enabled, e is also non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.745673574Z"}
{"id":"8150ae7f-5df5-499d-88f7-0e3205268f67","expr":"logger == null || logger.isDebugEnabled() == false || true","rationale":"This is to reflect that debug is only called when debug is enabled, though trivial.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.746240415Z"}
{"id":"a10b45ca-b716-4ac9-9154-9276f58dfa91","expr":"logger == null || logger.isDebugEnabled()","rationale":"This expression captures the method precondition for debug call.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.746240415Z"}
{"id":"032081f6-96b8-4e68-af4a-59d05eca92bb","expr":"logger != null && logger.isInfoEnabled() == false || logger.isInfoEnabled() == true","rationale":"logger.isInfoEnabled() returns a boolean indicating whether info-level logs are enabled.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.747747221Z"}
{"id":"e842cd6a-93c4-437f-805f-7003c99a2118","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The method exits immediately if logger is null, so nullness check is a relevant invariant.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.747747221Z"}
{"id":"271ff905-cd7f-4fc2-b5e5-9f28931e95a9","expr":"msg == null || msg.length() >= 0","rationale":"msg is a String so its length is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.747747221Z"}
{"id":"29d680c3-204a-4ac5-bf7c-fbf2dbc51039","expr":"logger != null && logger.isInfoEnabled() == true || msg == null || true","rationale":"If info logging is enabled, the message (may be null) is logged.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.747747221Z"}
{"id":"d1d7a0f1-5618-47d2-9876-ecd7580288f7","expr":"logger != null && !logger.isInfoEnabled() || msg != null","rationale":"If logger is non-null and info is enabled, then the msg is passed to logger.info, implying msg is the message to log.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.748007533Z"}
{"id":"e5a55a82-eb73-4d09-b503-4411d259b170","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"Since method returns when logger is null, logger is not null at this point.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.748007533Z"}
{"id":"7a2ff89b-41d3-4793-a0ad-6a1110063595","expr":"logger != null || e == null","rationale":"If logger is null, method returns early; no logging happens","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.748302991Z"}
{"id":"f0ba8775-74dd-4cf9-b7d9-949b55c3802b","expr":"logger.isInfoEnabled() == true || logger.isInfoEnabled() == false","rationale":"The isInfoEnabled method must return boolean","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.748302991Z"}
{"id":"2bc9b3ff-5ffb-4ad1-aa2e-894a400b6210","expr":"(!logger.isInfoEnabled() || logger.isInfoEnabled())","rationale":"At method entry, isInfoEnabled is either true or false","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.748302991Z"}
{"id":"5d29973f-9fa6-42bf-8826-ea0a4a31b6c5","expr":"(logger.isInfoEnabled() && logger != null) || !(logger.isInfoEnabled() && logger != null)","rationale":"Reflects control flow logic before calling logger.info(e)","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.748302991Z"}
{"id":"61921837-91c1-4bc0-a50b-c5831e36f06a","expr":"(logger != null)","rationale":"The method immediately returns if logger is null, so if we are past entry, logger is not null","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.748302991Z"}
{"id":"c15562a7-38df-4739-b99d-8ec447bbee41","expr":"logger.isInfoEnabled() || true","rationale":"Excluded.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.748007533Z"}
{"id":"841a74fd-00ea-4a63-be0f-7071a39d1be6","expr":"msg == null || msg.length() >= 0","rationale":"msg is either null or a String, so its length is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.748007533Z"}
{"id":"5b36465f-abcc-4044-af21-86e77e325526","expr":"logger != null || msg != null || e != null","rationale":"logger can be null before method executes; msg and e can be null without constraint.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.749252395Z"}
{"id":"fb59ae86-270e-4efd-acd3-928604bfb85b","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"Method returns if logger is null; at exit, logger is definitely not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.748951306Z"}
{"id":"8cd133ee-03ba-44b4-bb6b-bd5669fecec5","expr":"!logger.isInfoEnabled() || logger != null","rationale":"If logger is not null, then either info is enabled or not; at exit, logger!=null holds.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.748951306Z"}
{"id":"1ebc38f1-edb1-472c-99cb-c1c9e51eb955","expr":"logger == null || logger.isInfoEnabled() == true","rationale":"logger is either null or its info logging is enabled or disabled.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.749252395Z"}
{"id":"44255a4a-bfc4-4640-a13f-ec1a95718598","expr":"logger != null || msg == null || e == null","rationale":"The method returns immediately if logger is null, so the nullness of msg and e is unrestricted in that case.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.750081982Z"}
{"id":"d9377567-25e5-4ab8-b9fa-80d7a9ebf7ee","expr":"msg == null || msg.length() >= 0","rationale":"msg may be null or a String of non-negative length since it's a Java String.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.750081982Z"}
{"id":"ad6aedb5-7dee-48c0-942d-6a373bc4e41c","expr":"logger != null && (!logger.isInfoEnabled() || (msg != null || e != null))","rationale":"Since info is called only if logger is not null and isInfoEnabled, msg or e must be provided.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.750173194Z"}
{"id":"3153ab94-2b9b-4250-951d-ff8c3007d8e1","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"Method returns before this point if logger is null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.750173194Z"}
{"id":"d9241116-0e29-4417-acd6-d0f73acfda79","expr":"!logger.isInfoEnabled() || (msg != null || e != null)","rationale":"If info is enabled, then there is a valid input to log.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.750173194Z"}
{"id":"c9070006-6bbc-455f-9b83-41d160461b2d","expr":"logger == null || logger.isWarnEnabled() == true || logger.isWarnEnabled() == false","rationale":"logger.isWarnEnabled() is boolean if logger is non-null","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.750634796Z"}
{"id":"0c0db44b-2f4b-46ca-b5ff-fdfc5bc1b6ef","expr":"logger == null || (!logger.isWarnEnabled() || true)","rationale":"When logger is non-null and warn is not enabled, the method returns quietly","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.750634796Z"}
{"id":"37438a86-9797-4194-8eaa-09289c0512ea","expr":"logger == null || logger.isWarnEnabled() || !logger.isWarnEnabled()","rationale":"Logger is either null or warn is enabled or disabled","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.750634796Z"}
