{"id":"0ac4cbb2-09f8-4075-8695-42a55351c9d7","expr":"m1.getName().compareTo(m2.getName()) == 0 || m1.getParameterTypes().length != m2.getParameterTypes().length","rationale":"If method names are equal, then parameter types arrays might differ in length or vice versa.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodComparator#compare(Method,Method):int","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodComparator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:13:50.756703710Z"}
